---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="buildings" title="Building Events" active="building-events" pageMark="🧱">
  The decisions that can appear when a city finishes an ordinary
  <a href={`${base}urban-improvements`}>building or improvement</a>, such as a Barracks, Library,
  Market, Temple, Quarry or Grove. As with the <a href={`${base}wonder-events`}>wonder</a> and
  <a href={`${base}project-events`}>project</a> events, each building has its own weighted pool, so
  finishing a Quarry might roll <em>Ancient Statue</em>, one of the <em>Dinosaur Bones</em> stories,
  or <em>Disturbed Rest</em>, and the share shown is within that building's pool. A weight is the
  value in the XML rather than a real in-game chance, because character and empire conditions filter
  what is eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
